y":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible on latest Godot[master] (f.ex. commit [e1a8a4e](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/e1a8a4e98e0558fb35e76dd15aeb785151d70c9b))\n- Not reproducible on [Godot 4.8-dev3](https://godotengine.org/download/archive/4.8-dev3/)\n\nTested on macOS.\n\n### System information\n\nmacOS\n\n### Issue description\n\nDrag & Dropping a \".tscn\" from the FileSystem dock to the Scene Tree Dock fails and prints:\n```\n  ERROR: Node not found: \"Cubes\" (relative to \"/root/@EditorNode@20459/@Panel@14/@VBoxContainer@16/DockVSplitMain/DockHSplitMain/DockVSplitLeftR/DockSlotLeftUR/Scene\").\n  ERROR: editor/docks/scene_tree_dock.cpp:3664 - Parameter \"node\" is null.\n```\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c1c2fd6e-68b8-447b-8c94-83178656f075\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open a Godot project (new or old)\n2. Drag & Drop a \".tscn\" into the scene tree\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nMinimal project (used in the video above):\n[editor-drag-drop-bug-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31391781/editor-drag-drop-bug-test.zip)\n\nBut this bug is not project dependent, and can be reproduced with a brand new project (or an existing project).","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.git